// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P168123509" "I'm glad you're here, heroes. You see, I've got a problem. A big problem. It's my wife. You may know her as Sister Psyche, but her real name is Aurora Scott. Ever since Sister Psyche was injured in the war, her consciousness has been residing within Aurora, working through my wife to continue her watch over Paragon City. <br><br>Aurora considers it an honor, and she'd never do anything to let Sister Psyche down. But lately, there's something wrong with her. I think someone is trying to disrupt their mental connection, and it's tearing her apart. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Please, help me save my wife!</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3331052278" "Help Calvin save his wife"
// SendOffString :
"P1539718982" "She acts like there's nothing wrong, but I know her. Believe me, {TaskForceName}, there's something bad going on. I've got a lead on a Council base that's been doing some investigation into psychic powers. Perhaps they're the ones interfering with the connection between Sister Psyche and my wife."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P247600577" "Defeat all agents in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3049198201" "I need you to find out what's happening to my wife!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2358766126" "You hear a sudden scream."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P871174980" "Arachnos Operative"
// Description :
"P480797583" "Seek clues"
// InteractBeginString :
"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3070343862" "Somehow, they knew!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3073612403" "You learned about the Council's experiments in psychic probing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3035818600" "It sounds as though the Council's psychic probing has to do with rooting out spies within their ranks. Pretty creepy, but it doesn't explain the change in Aurora's connection to Sister Psyche. I'll have to dig deeper."
// RandomFameString :
"P1303572055" "I hear {TaskForceName} uncovered an Arachnos spy!"

