// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P7376830" "I believe I can make out some of the Rikti symbology. Let's see. It seems the Rikti were attempting to contact some other plane of existence psychically. If they could establish psychic contact with their own home world, that could mean vastly improved military efficiency. Luckily for us, their experiment seems to be going nowhere. <br><br>I'm sorry, {TaskForceName}, but this doesn't seem to be connected to the disruption of Sister Psyche's connection to Aurora Borealis. Maybe Calvin's just getting worked up for no reason. After all, it can't be easy to have a wife with two minds."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2511161853" "Another dead end. Look, {taskForceName}, I know a lot of people think I'm just creating a fuss over nothing. But I know my wife! She's not the same. And if someone doesn't get to the bottom of this, she may never be!"
// RandomFameString :
"P832527561" "Do you believe what Calvin Scott says about his wife? {TaskForceName} seems to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4275330239" "Okay, Task Force {TaskForceName}, here's the deal. You've been kicking villain tail all across Paragon City, but we're still no closer to figuring out what's wrong with the connection between my wife and Sister Psyche. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So, I think it's time to kick a little more tail.</A> Or a lot more, to be exact."
// AcceptString :
"P101596153" "Interrogate more villains"
// SendOffString :
"P2243516670" "I want you to hit the streets, and don't stop until you find a lead."

