"P1048582113" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to take this tome you found over to Azuria.</A> Maybe she can analyze it and let us know if the Circle really is interfering with Aurora's mental connection to Sister Psyche."
// AcceptString :
"P1487540928" "Take the tome to Azuria"
// SendOffString :
"P2088688792" "Please do anything Azuria asks of you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1699315632" "Take tome to Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P12440651" "I'd like Azuria to see that tome."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3016585906" "Retrieve the tome!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3500058423" "So, this is the tome Calvin spoke of. Let me see. It seems that the Circle of Thorns has found a way to target Sister Psyche through her mental connection to Aurora Borealis. {TaskForceName}, this is horrible! If Sister Psyche remains in Aurora's body for too much longer, the Circle could dissolve both of their personalities. We wouldn't just be losing one of the city's greatest heroines; we'd also be losing one of our brightest potential stars: Aurora! <br><br>I think I can stop this, but first I need to know how much progress the Circle has already made. I want you to investigate one of their lairs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P281501454" "Defeat Tyrkis & his coven"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3867409856" "If Azuria thinks you can find more details in that Circle lair, you should follow up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1023678512" "The scent of cloves fills the air."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3699864380" "Tyrkis"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2414704255" "The ritual will be complete soon."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4180164918" "Do not let {TaskForceName} disrupt the ritual!"

