"P3994121044" "You defeated the Circle and learned about their plans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3124543481" "Great work, {TaskForceName}! I have to thank you for trusting me on this. I'm not a hero; I'm not a well-known contact in town. I'm just a guy trying to save his wife. I appreciate everything you're doing for her."
// RandomFameString :
"P1323462746" "{TaskForceName} is after the Circle of Thorns!"

