// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3120715166" "I hope those books you found will tell Azuria how to break the spell that's targeting my wife's mental connection to Sister Psyche. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You better get them over to her.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3364580247" "Take the books to Azuria"
// SendOffString :
"P2683844904" "Thanks, {TaskForceName}. I'm sure Azuria will know just what to do."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2561931718" "Take books to Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3831594812" "Azuria needs to see those books if she's going to help my wife and Sister Psyche."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3317998677" "Revenge! Revenge for {TaskForceName}'s intrusion!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3468819877" "Thank you, brave heroes. I will examine these books at once. If Sister Psyche's presence within Aurora's mind is what allowed the Circle to target her, perhaps it is time to dissolve that union. I have long been researching the spells necessary to restore Sister Psyche's original body to health. I suppose it is time to make the attempt. <br><br>I will begin work immediately. It will take me some time to perform the ritual; after all, the minds of Aurora and Psyche have become largely intertwined. But I must begin to draw them apart."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P259318434" "I can hardly believe it's true. Sister Psyche has been living within my wife's body for so long, I'd almost gotten used to it. Still, it was hard sometimes, knowing that there was someone else looking out at me from her eyes. Now, Azuria's finally going to return Sister Psyche to her own body and return my precious Aurora to me. It's almost too good to be true!"
// RandomFameString :
"P402092325" "{TaskForceName}'s been consulting with Azuria lately."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3358703578" "While Azuria works on the spell that will return Sister Psyche to her body, we've got more work to do. It seems the Freedom Phalanx was so impressed with our work uncovering the Circle plot, they want to see more of what we can do together. I could hardly turn them down. So, what do you way? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you take on a new threat with me?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2346294983" "Take on a new threat with Calvin"
// SendOffString :
"P896900746" "Apparently there's a new villain in town. Some of the Freakshow seem to be flocking to his banner. I need you to go to a warehouse where they're massed and see if you can find out who this new player is."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1423770425" "Defeat Punkadelic & his cronies"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1871374185" "Have you figured out who this new villain is yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1498461045" "A steady bass beat echoes through these corridors."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3155281311" "Punkadelic"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4005447436" "The new man's crazy! I mean, kuh-razy!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2837396208" "{TaskForceName} don't need to hear about this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Punkadelic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2572344094" "When you defeated Punkadelic, he gasped, 'Okay, okay, here's the story: the new man says he's got the inside scoop on the heroes. We thought we'd go along for the ride!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P441331362" "You defeated the Freaks and learned about their new leader."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P901735749" "I guess it shouldn't surprise me that the Freaks are willing to follow anyone who claims to be able to bring them some power. I still don't know who this new villain is, or why he claims to know all about the heroes of Paragon City. But I know we better track him down before he causes any more trouble."
// RandomFameString :
"P1182830618" "{TaskForceName} is on the trail of some new villain!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2691314672" "All right. We know this new villain in town claims to know all about Paragon City's greatest heroes. And we know he's working with the Freaks. It seem to me there's only one thing to do , Task Force {TaskForceName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to go to the streets and track him down.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1034444690" "Track down the new villain"
// SendOffString :
"P1395777932" "Some of the Freaks may know where he's holed up. Start with them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4262877549" "Interrogate Freakshow"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3131014703" "We still don't know where to find this new villain."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P994167598" "The new guy says to waste these jerks!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P703331095" "One of the Freaks you defeated gave up the location of his leader's lair."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1145554724" "So, this new villain is holed up in Brickstown, eh? You'll have to go after him, {TaskForceName}. If he really does have the secrets of Paragon City's heroes, we can't allow them to fall into the hands of the Freakshow!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2583337915" "The Freaks are afraid of {TaskForceName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P435296262" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to take out this new villain, Task Force {TaskForceName}.</A> I don't know who he is, but I know the Freaks are following him because he claims to know all about the secrets of Paragon City's heroes. That's a huge threat, but I believe you are strong enough to stop it."
// AcceptString :
"P2491934190" "Take out the new villain"
// SendOffString :
"P3850487468" "Thanks for taking this on, heroes. It takes real courage to march into the unknown."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P245318236" "Defeat Malaise & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1070176024" "You've got to stand tall for all of Paragon City's heroes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3253228291" "You hear the sound of unhinged laughter."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3544190908" "Malaise"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2297625442" "I am finally free of that hag, Sister Psyche!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P404903534" "Ah, {TaskForceName}! The very ones who released me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2021593585" "You defeated Malaise."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1071058891" "It seems that when Azuria began her spell to return Sister Psyche to her own body, Psyche's mental hold on Malaise was broken. He lost his head and went evil again. He says it was just a brief fit of lunacy, but to tell you the truth, {TaskForceName}, I've got my doubts. I hope you'll help me keep an eye on him until Azuria finishes her spell and Sister Psyche is back at work in her own body."
// RandomFameString :
"P184694521" "I hear Sister Psyche's returning to her own body soon, thanks to {TaskForceName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P402957259" "Azuria's still hard at work on the spell that will put Sister Psyche back in her own body. During the process, a small part of each woman's soul was cast free. Luckily, Azuria managed to capture the soul fragments in this crystal orb. Aurora and Sister Psyche will be fine, as long as someone protects those soul fragments. I can't think of a better person than you."
